      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "WORKED_EXAMPLE",
      "narration_text": "This is what a tool looks like, in the shape the spec defines. An illustrative example of my own: search textbook. A name, a plain-language description, and a schema for its inputs, a book and a query. On the right, the call a client sends. Notice the description does real work. It's how the model decides when this tool is the right one.",
